{"v":4,"catch":"歡迎來到天堂天堂！","desc":"《EMERALDIA》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1993年發行的解謎動作遊戲。\n掉落的立方體可以通過將相同顏色的立方體掉落兩次並將它們碰撞在一起來粉碎。\n遊戲有三種模式：享受故事的冒險模式、享受謎題的普通模式以及對戰模式。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-04-18","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cda89fc784d85bc69d186133ca47f8ebabaafc07ccf5335ea3c73bc3d98b2925.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f9c76f39b8ce660b577c793bb19b612f3a6d36f69be47a169df731ce075979f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8e5a8b9fb3b54fec199171f62f91f2a5f0f3d02bfcb87f813367523eee9c9a5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bab9c327bf8f68f4bd0b00fb96ba05d112b2b490e42d0f7e1a06c59515967227.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/266f8a55884bd87e568c86f95db7e2ad0924207757bd892cb6c5fd7238cf7af8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00e8098c086214967149f69bff27982f5e23f34fc85ede7ecc368bc6d785fdf7.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b5801de08000","dlc":[]}